OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters remove 8km hose after
OL,4,Aforest wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have begun removing a 8km
OL,7,F(5 mile) long hose used to tackle a
OL,8,Flarge wildfire.
OL,10,FA major incident was declared in the
OL,11,FNew Forest, Hampshire, after a van fire
OL,12,Fon the A31 near Ringwood on 9 August
OL,13,Fwent on to destroy about 1.6 sq km (0.6
OL,14,Fsq miles) of heathland.
OL,16,FHampshire and Isle of Wight Fire and
OL,17,FRescue Service said residents have had
OL,18,Frestricted access to and from their
OL,19,Fhomes while crews used a High Volume
OL,20,FPump (HVP) to collect more than
OL,21,F85-million litres of water from
OL,22,FHightown Lake to tackle the blaze.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
